      "id": 55223,
      "name": "Ronway",
      "username": "Ronway",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-03-16T03:25:44.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Granted Grenade launcher could of said deal 2 targets 2 projectile damage and deal a third target 1 projectile, but i think it looks neater since the card is a bit different then others.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>There are times where you can choose to hit the same target twice or two different targets. The only ones that come to mind as of right now are Argent's Frost and Flame and Omnitron-X's Rocket Punch. The wording on those are \"Deal 1 target X damage. Deal 1 target X damage.\" The reason for it working like this is because it doesn't specify that it isn't a second target or another target or anything of the sort. Using Throwing knives you can hit up to 3 targets, if you chose the same target twice you are still only dealing 1 target damage, so it would be an invalid move.</p>",
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:29:53.627Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
